# Phase 4: frame generation switched on and off while playing (set frame_generation).
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 3s
trigger rt 0.4
stick lx 0.1
wait 5s
mark off1
wait 8s
set frame_generation fsr
mark on1
wait 10s
set frame_generation off
mark off2
wait 8s
set frame_generation fsr
mark on2
wait 10s
set hdr off
mark on2_sdr
wait 6s
set frame_generation off
mark off3
wait 6s
release all
mark end
wait 1s
